{"slug": "icgeb-postdoctoral-fellowships", "kind": "scholarship", "host": "ICGEB", "title_ar": "زمالات ICGEB لما بعد الدكتوراه", "title_en": "ICGEB Postdoctoral Fellowships", "summary_ar": "زمالات ممولة بالكامل لما بعد الدكتوراه لسنتين مع سنة إضافية محتملة في Trieste أو نيودلهي أو كيب تاون، يقدمها ICGEB لمواطني الدول الأعضاء ومنها العراق. تدفع 2,300 يورو أو 1,749 دولارًا أو 27,500 راند شهريًا مع التأمين والسفر والتأشيرة. يفتح الإعلان المقبل في يناير 2027.", "summary_en": "Fully funded two-year postdoctoral fellowships, with one possible extra year, in Trieste, New Delhi or Cape Town, from ICGEB, for nationals of member states including Iraq. Pays EUR 2,300, US$1,749 or ZAR 27,500 monthly plus insurance, travel and visa. Next call opens in January 2027.", "location": "Trieste, New Delhi and Cape Town", "remote": false, "apply_url": "https://www.icgeb.org/fellowship/", "applicant_fee": 0, "fee_note": null, "opens_at": null, "deadline": "2027-03-31T23:59:59+03:00", "levels": ["postdoc"], "min_age": null, "max_age": null, "destination_countries": ["IT", "IN", "ZA"], "funding_type": "fully_funded", "iraqi_eligibility": "named_official", "source_url": "https://www.icgeb.org/fellowships/arturo-falaschi-postdoctoral-fellowships-september-2026/", "last_checked_on": "2026-11-04"},
